# Python tests (EMIC)

- Use pytest with `asyncio_mode=auto` for async code.
- API route tests: shared `client` fixture in `backend/tests/conftest.py`; helpers in `backend/tests/helpers.py`.
- Mock external HTTP at provider boundaries (`OpenMeteoWeatherProvider`, `create_heartbeat_client`, `ChargeAmpsMeterAdapter.build`).
- Pure logic in `packages/energy-core`: fast unit tests, no production DB or network.
- Mark PostgreSQL-only tests with `@pytest.mark.integration`.
